# Harmonica in enthusi's space

Welcome! Here you'll find a growing collection of harmonica tabs that I've
reformatted for comfortable reading in Gemini browsers.

## Songs

=> happybirthday.gmi Happy Birthday [easy]
=> soundsofsilence.gmi The Sound of Silence [easy]
=> suicideispainless.gmi M*A*S*H Theme [easy]
=> sinceidonthaveyou.gmi Since I don't have you [medium]

## About

The tabs use a simple numeric notation:

* Positive numbers are blow notes.
* Negative numbers are draw notes.

